{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09551","headline":"杜侍御送贡物戏赠 · 张谓","name":"杜侍御送贡物戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜柱朱崖道路难，伏波横海旧登坛。\n越人自贡珊瑚树，汉使何劳獬豸冠。\n疲马山中愁日晚，孤舟江上畏春寒。\n由来此货称难得，多恐君王不忍看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"陈耀东"}